## 🎓 Learning Outcomes

After completing this project, users will be able to:

🔹 Apply statistical analysis techniques

🔹 Understand covariance and correlation

🔹 Compute eigenvalues and eigenvectors

🔹 Implement LU and SVD decompositions

🔹 Interpret dimensionality reduction results

🔹 Analyze datasets using mathematical foundations


## 🏁 Conclusion

The **Calculative Foundation** project successfully demonstrates the practical implementation of essential mathematical and statistical concepts using Python. Through covariance analysis, eigenvalue decomposition, LU decomposition, and Singular Value Decomposition (SVD), the project provides a strong understanding of the computational techniques used in data analysis and machine learning. The results highlight the importance of linear algebra and statistics in extracting meaningful insights from data and building a solid foundation for advanced analytical applications.
